Subject: [PATCH 3236/3799] soh: rename D_8082AE08 -> sUnusedAreaIndices

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: a twenty-entry area index table nothing in the overlay reads; sAreaGsIndices covers the twelve the world map actually uses
Defined in soh/src/overlays/misc/ovl_kaleido_scope/z_kaleido_scope_PAL.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/misc/ovl_kaleido_scope/z_kaleido_scope_PAL.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/misc/ovl_kaleido_scope/z_kaleido_scope_PAL.c b/soh/src/overlays/misc/ovl_kaleido_scope/z_kaleido_scope_PAL.c
index 9a03b40a2..ec383f451 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/misc/ovl_kaleido_scope/z_kaleido_scope_PAL.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/misc/ovl_kaleido_scope/z_kaleido_scope_PAL.c
@@ -1963,7 +1963,7 @@ void KaleidoScope_DrawInfoPanel(PlayState* play) {
     };
     static s16 sInfoPanelFadeTimer = 20;  // was D_8082AE00 [LLM:HIGH]
     static s16 sInfoPanelColorIdx = 0;  // was D_8082AE04 [LLM:HIGH]
-    static s16 D_8082AE08[] = {
+    static s16 sUnusedAreaIndices[] = {  // was D_8082AE08 [LLM:GUESS]
         10, 16, 16, 17, 12, 13, 18, 17, 17, 19, 13, 21, 20, 21, 14, 15, 15, 15, 11, 14,
     };
     static s16 D_8082AE30[] = {
